            <p class="pkg-tagline">A story worth framing.</p>
            <div class="pkg-price"><span class="currency">USD</span><span class="amount">450</span></div>
            <div class="pkg-divider"></div>
            <ul class="pkg-features">
              <li><span class="icon-check">✓</span><span>Half day — 4 hours</span></li>
              <li><span class="icon-check">✓</span><span>Unlimited locations in Hội An and Da Nang</span></li>
              <li><span class="icon-check">✓</span><span>50 edited photos</span></li>
              <li><span class="icon-check">✓</span><span>Private online gallery</span></li>
              <li class="value-add"><span class="icon-star">★</span><span>Activity guide + planning call</span></li>
              <li class="value-add"><span class="icon-star">★</span><span>1 black &amp; white photo — documentary style, ready to frame</span></li>
              <li class="value-add"><span class="icon-star">★</span><span>30-sec mini video slideshow to share</span></li>
              <li class="value-add"><span class="icon-star">★</span><span>RAW files of all edited photos</span></li>
